9eae-8476e8f0af91\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568015184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568025252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113057#issuecomment-3568025252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113057","id":3568025252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uq76k","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T14:39:44Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T14:39:44Z","body":"As the `AutoloadInfo` is used everywhere, I tried to ensure the path in `AutoloadInfo` is in the form of `res://`, but failed. It turned out that this will be called before file system scan, so it cannot transfer `uid://...` to `res://...`. Instead, it gets an empty String.\n\nDo you have any ideas?\n\n<img width=\"711\" height=\"597\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa68f307-4311-4908-bc3e-e1a85a132215\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568025252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568111700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113057#issuecomment-3568111700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113057","id":3568111700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UrRBU","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T16:08:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T12:40:28Z","body":"Update: #113005 can fix this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568111700/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718064979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113057#issuecomment-3718064979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113057","id":3718064979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dnStT","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T09:46:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T09:46:06Z","body":"@KoBeWi \nI think the PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113088 didn't fix the issue, at least not for me. I ran into it in 4.6.beta2 where the fix should be present (unless I am mistaken).\n\nThe fix goes through autoloads and fixes paths. But why is there a uid in the first place? It looks like the file's uid/path in the cache is somehow corrupted so ensure_path doesn't seem to work.\n\nI added a new autoload script on one pc. Later I transfered the changes to a second pc using git. On the second pc I get a \"Failed to instantiate autoload\" error. Everything works fine on the first pc even though the code is identical on both pcs.\n\n- Both pcs run godot 4.6.beta2. \n- On both pcs there is a uid instead of a path in project.godot.\n- On the first pc there is the correct path in Project settings -> Globals.\n- On the second pc there is an empty path in Project settings -> Globals.\n- When I remove and readd the script on the first pc it works but there is still a uid in project.godot.\n- When I remove and readd the script on the second pc it remains broken.\n- When I add another script on the second pc, it displays fine in Project settings -> Globals but there is still a uid instead of a path in project.godot.\n- Reloading project with or without the broken script in the autoload doesn't change anything.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718064979/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718458953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113057#issuecomment-3718458953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113057","id":3718458953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7doy5J","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T11:32:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T11:32:00Z","body":"Sounds like you are not committing .uid files to VCS? The script's .uid file has to exist on both PCs and contain the same UID, so the script can be found.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718458953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718692294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113057#issuecomment-3718692294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113057","id":3718692294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dpr3G","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}